# Deploy checklist (Cloud Run + StaffingOS)

Before **any** production deploy (`scripts/deploy-cloudrun.sh`, `scripts/deploy-with-env.mjs`, or `gcloud builds submit`):

1. **On `main`** (or merge target) with latest changes pulled.
2. **`npm run build`** — must pass locally. This runs the same TypeScript check Cloud Build uses; do not skip.
3. Deploy only after build is green.

After deploy:

1. Confirm Cloud Run revision is serving 100% traffic.
2. `GET /login` returns 200 on https://opelsoft-dashboard-ulla3fdzha-uc.a.run.app
3. Smoke-test critical paths changed in the release (e.g. Activity Logs sidebar label, `/logs` tabs, entity timelines).

GCP defaults for this repo: `GCP_PROJECT_ID=staffingos-500618`, `GCP_REGION=us-central1`, `SITE_URL=https://opelsoft-dashboard-ulla3fdzha-uc.a.run.app`. Env vars come from `.env.local` via `scripts/deploy-with-env.mjs`.
